        "(df['f02'] == 'tcp') | ((df['f14'] == 0) & (df['f15'] == 0))",
        "True"
      ],
      "features": ["f02", "f14", "f15"],
      "rationale": "Retransmissions are TCP-specific, but dropped packets may occur in any protocol."
